          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kakuba orugendo rukubeera rukooto otarukusobora kuleeta kimu kya ikumi eky'ebi oyereze, MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe ebiyakuhairemu omugisa, ekiikaro MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe eki yakomere kumuramizaamu, habw'okukuba hara muno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu, kimu kya ikumi eky'eby'okulya noikirizibwa kuhingisaamu sente. Sente ezi ogende ozikwasire omungaro, ogende omukiikaro MUKAMA ekiyakomere kumuramizaamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oziguze ekintu kyona ekyorukugonza: ente, entaama, rundi ekyokunywa eky'amaani, oku nuho oliriira, kandi osemererwe neeka yawe omumaiso ga MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omuleevi anyakuli omumbuga z'owanyu, otalimwebwa, habwokuba uwe tanyina mugabo rundi ensi ei yagabaine na inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli myaka esatu obweraahwahoga, omu mwaka ogu gwonka, oleeteremuga kimu kya ikumi ekya byona ebi wakeeza, obituume omurubuga balye kandi baigute; nukwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu abahe omugisa omu bintu byona ebi mutaho engaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
